  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When trying to move a Binary, from path \"/test/image\" to \"/test/image1\", the following error occurs:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "javax.jcr.nodetype.ConstraintViolationException: Unable to add child 'image1' with primary type 'nt:resource' to parent at /test with primary type 'nt:folder' and mixins fedora:Container,fedora:Resource} in workspace 'default' of repository 'repo' because: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "child's primary type 'nt:resource' does not satisfy parent's child definition: nt:folder/* (required primary types = [nt:hierarchyNode])",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I'm assuming, by reading the REST API documentation (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API),"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API),",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " that a Binary is a resource as a Container is and therefore should be possible to move (as I have tested and seen working with Containers).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "How to reproduce (using fcrepo-webapp-4.[234].0-jetty-console.jar):",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) Create container",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "$> curl -i -X PUT \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2) Create binary",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "$> curl -X PUT --upload-file ~/Desktop/JavaSE6\\ HotSpotVirtualMachineHeapByGenerationsSchema.png -H\"Content-Type: image/png\" \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test/image"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test/image",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "3) Move binary (i.e. rename it in this case)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "$> curl -X MOVE -H \"Destination: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test/image1"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test/image1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\" \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test/image"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test/image",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
